WEBVTT

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:34.820
That's it.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:38.620
That's Yorunami's palace, Tamayori.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:41.830
It certainly has the look 
of a Twelve Shinsho palace.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.840
Well, it's not as big as mine.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:45.930
Sure, sure.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:55.260
<i>I believe you can return him 
to the way he once was.</i>

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.640
The way he was...

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:03.220
Life Force

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:03.220
<i>Done!</i>

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.470
<i>For me?</i>

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:08.670
<i>Yes. I made it for you, Mother.</i>

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:13.210
<i>You made this?</i>

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:13.900
<i>Yes.</i>

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.360
<i>Yorunami...</i>

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.070
<i>Yes?</i>

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.070
<i>If you have that much free time, 
use it for martial arts training.</i>

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.580
<i>This is just a waste of time.</i>

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:26.990
<i>Mother...</i>

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.280
The Hayagami Tsukuyo, 
the origin of all things.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.170
Once I obtain it, the throne 
is as good as mine.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.720
This time, I know you 
will be pleased, Mother.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.870
Is Kanate back from scouting the area?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:52.250
Lord Kannagi just left to look for him.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.010
He thinks Kanate may have 
been caught by a guard.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:59.390
For all their talk, 
those two get along well.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:00.650
I guess so.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:02.630
Oh, uh...

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:03.600
And you...

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.870
Aren't you lonely?

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.710
You want to return to your 
own world, don't you?

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.310
You have people you care about,

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.950
and someone you love, I'm sure.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:22.850
I'll watch over you until 
the day you make it back.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.140
Kotoha...

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.520
S-Sorry. That was a weird 
thing to say, huh?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.930
<i>I never even thought about it.</i>

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.660
<i>I just want to live up to 
the princess's trust in me.</i>

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:45.660
<i>And I thought, in this world, 
I could change myself.</i>

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.170
<i>But beyond that,</i>

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:50.910
I...

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.420
Arata!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.480
Kotoha!

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.070
Kotoha...

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:23.460
What was that?

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.920
Yorunami's power.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.490
Arata!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:30.830
<i>Kotoha...</i>

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.420
He runs too fast!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.960
Kanate, you said the gate to 
Tamayori was open, right?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.090
Yeah, and there weren't any guards.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.050
<i>Be careful, Arata.</i>

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.640
Kotoha!

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.940
Arata...

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.480
Are you okay? You're not hurt, are you?

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.360
I...

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.280
Water...

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.690
I'll get you out of there!

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:11.200
Appear!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:16.620
It won't work.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:23.360
Such a Kamui is not 
enough to break that sphere.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.550
Welcome, Arata the Sho.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.400
Yorunami!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.220
That's him?!

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:35.560
Well, if it isn't the man whose 
Hayagami was stolen by Akachi.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.190
Let Kotoha go!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.860
Submit to me, or make me submit.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.800
Then she will be set free.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.130
Coward!

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.200
Kotoha has nothing to do with 
either of us submitting!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:56.870
I will do whatever it takes to 
achieve my goal with perfection.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.250
What?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.580
Everything I do is to fulfill 
my mother's wishes.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:04.300
I will not allow failure.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.260
Mother, watch as I force

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.410
the strongest of Hayagami 
and its Sho to submit to me.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.580
Appear,

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.610
Nakisawa!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.320
Appear!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:28.310
Kotoha-chan!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.830
Useless interlopers should 
just keep quiet and watch.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.380
Are you sure about this, Hiruko?

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:44.710
If Arata is forced to submit, 
we will also suffer the consequences.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:49.480
But you want to see Lord Yorunami 
return to the way he was, don't you?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.670
I'm counting on you, Arata.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.710
I see.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.730
So Arata was headed toward Yorunami.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.710
Then, that boy must be 
on his way there, too.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.030
<i>My eye...</i>

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.280
<i>There are things you can only 
see after you've lost them.</i>

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:19.370
<i>I once lost everything.</i>

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.630
<i>It was only when I realized</i>

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:27.340
<i>I had nothing more to lose 
that I gained my power.</i>

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:32.690
<i>You can get stronger 
when that happens?</i>

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.300
<i>Then I'll be like you!</i>

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.130
<i>Have that treated.</i>

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:42.490
<i>Wait!</i>

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.740
<i>I want to be stronger!</i>

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:48.860
<i>I'll give an eye if it'll 
let me defeat Hinohara!</i>

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.490
<i>I want to be stronger!</i>

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.910
<i>It seems you've made your decision.</i>

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.910
<i>In deference to your resolve,</i>

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.300
<i>I shall give you one of mine.</i>

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:19.270
What happened between 
you and Lord Akachi?

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:20.850
Why do you ask?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.370
Well, you just seem different.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.320
For the first time, I wanted 
to get closer to someone.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:34.020
Akachi was the first person 
to see me for who I am.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:38.530
Hinohara, I can't wait to see you.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.110
Arata! Behind you!

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.340
Tsukuyo!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.270
You should be ashamed 
of your own folly.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.390
Kotoha!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.210
Mizuha!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:15.740
Arata!

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:19.660
That's...

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.740
The Time Reversal Jutsu!

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.110
He's in trouble! 
Anyone hit by that technique...

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:33.510
What's that?!

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:36.150
Appear, Orochi!

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.030
Hinohara!

00:09:58.750 --> 00:09:59.880
Hinohara!

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.740
You! What did you do to him?!

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.940
The Sho of Orochi...

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.630
Arata the Sho has fallen asleep.

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:12.090
And he will submit to me in his sleep.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.750
What?!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:20.390
I'm the one who'll defeat Hinohara!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.040
Hinohara!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.360
I shall bring you along, as well.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.700
What?!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:02.430
<i>So warm... This feels nice.</i>

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.400
<i>I feel relieved for some reason.</i>

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.300
Mom?

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.280
It's my special consommé soup.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.030
You like it, right?

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.900
Yeah! Thanks!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.160
It's great!

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.960
I'm so glad.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.850
Oh, yes. There's something 
I want to ask you.

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.290
Oh, what?

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:35.000
How does the Oath to Submit go again?

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:39.940
You know it, don't you? 
Tell your mother.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.490
Arata.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.160
Sorry...

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.950
I can't tell you that.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.150
Hinohara...

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.720
You still have your will?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.530
Better go back further, then!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.520
<i>Mom...</i>

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.830
Oh dear. You got into 
a fight at school?

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.360
I'm tired of it!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.690
All right. I know.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.210
You don't have to go to school anymore.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.320
If it's painful for 
you, then just quit.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.120
You don't have to look at 
things you don't like.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.050
It's okay to run, Arata.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.520
Say the words that will 
make it all stop.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:35.300
It will be easier then. Right?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.510
Arata, you don't have to cry anymore.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:47.430
No one will ever pick on you.

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.270
You don't have to keep trying so hard.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.540
You've tried so hard 
for long enough.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:55.450
Mama...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.790
Go on. Say the chant.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:02.580
Hayagami Tsukuyo, submit now to...

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:04.760
Go on, say it.

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.420
Why?! Why won't you say it?!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.430
Why do you defy your mother?!

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:19.060
What's going on?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:23.190
As I expected, the likes of Yorunami 
can't make Arata submit.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.450
It can't be! To defy one's 
mother is unacceptable!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.280
Fine! If it comes to this, 
I don't need Tsukuyo!

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:35.460
Arata! You can just die where you are!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:41.460
Disappear, Arata!

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:47.060
Arata... Arata...

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.100
Who's there?

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:53.600
Wh-What's happening?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.060
Why is he growing?

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:56.850
Arata...

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:58.770
That voice...

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:02.320
Arata, don't give in.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:06.380
It's all right. I know you can do it.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.820
I'll be watching over you.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.410
Arata!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.950
Kotoha!

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:17.040
Arata?

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:25.410
Mom, I'm sorry I worried 
you all this time.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:28.680
But I'm okay now.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.100
And there's someone I love.

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:41.770
Go on.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:44.880
Yeah!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.620
Impossible!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.780
That's...

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.300
Wow...

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.150
He's...

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.250
Arata...

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.480
How dare you break my jutsu!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.600
Showing me visions of my mother

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.580
to try to make me submit won't work.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:57.140
My mother would never 
say anything like that.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.350
Besides...

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.390
I can walk on my own two feet now!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.620
Don't talk like you know anything!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.530
Nakisawa!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:09.840
What's going on?!

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.240
Looks like his Hayagami has 
lost the will to fight.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.200
I lost...

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.250
I've failed.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.080
Mother!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.790
Mother!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.060
Please forgive me.

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:43.980
Please forgive me, Mother.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:49.520
Lord Yorunami's real 
mother died long ago.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.850
That was an illusion that 
he created himself.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.080
Just a doll made of water.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:57.830
<i>You failed again?</i>

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>How many times before you get it right?</i>

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.320
<i>Do you understand that</i>

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:05.000
<i>it's your job to protect this 
house since your father died?</i>

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:09.250
<i>You will keep trying until 
you do a perfect job.</i>

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.030
<i>Yes, Mother.</i>

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.300
If I were perfect, 
she would praise me someday.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:19.010
She would accept me.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.520
I have worked hard believing that.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:25.850
But even after I became one 
of the Twelve Shinsho,

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.530
my mother didn't change.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.500
She died before she ever accepted me.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.010
My desire grew even stronger.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.460
I believed that if I became king,

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.870
my late mother would 
finally acknowledge me.

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:44.120
That's why you forced all 
your Zokusho to be perfect?

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.940
But that's all over now.

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.570
I failed.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:51.720
I could not make you submit!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.980
Yorunami...

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:05.810
Don't touch that! 
It's a memento of my mother!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.080
Memento? What's inside it?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:11.890
I don't know.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.400
<i>I leave this to you.</i>

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.410
<i>This is my treasure, my life force.</i>

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:23.710
<i>Understand that the day 
you fail to protect it</i>

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.380
<i>is the day you will die.</i>

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:30.960
How could I look inside

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.950
when I failed to fulfill 
my mother's wishes?

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:39.140
Don't you think, maybe, 
she wanted you to look?

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.220
She called it her own life 
force when she gave it to you.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:48.150
I think there may be a 
message to you inside it.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.410
A message to me?

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.860
Th-This is...

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:11.850
I thought she never wore it.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.210
But then, why...

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.410
If you'll pardon my saying so...

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:22.550
I know your true mother.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:28.930
She is not the strict woman 
of whom you speak.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:33.980
She was an exceptionally kind 
woman who loved her child.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.990
This brought her great suffering.

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:42.450
<i>If you'll pardon my saying so, 
was that not too strict?</i>

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.680
<i>He was crying.</i>

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.310
<i>Yorunami is too kind.</i>

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:50.610
<i>He's a quiet, spoiled child.</i>

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.540
<i>What will happen to him when 
both his father and I are gone?</i>

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.530
<i>If chaos were to overtake 
the nation again...</i>

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:03.860
<i>That is why I decided 
to be harsh with him.</i>

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:07.170
<i>It doesn't matter how much he hates me.</i>

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:11.770
<i>As long as he grows stronger, 
that's enough.</i>

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.110
<i>This is my treasure.</i>

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:17.850
<i>My life force.</i>

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.150
Mother...

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:34.600
Hiruko.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.490
Yes, Lord Yorunami?

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.640
I'm sorry. You were right.

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:47.050
Arata the Sho has freed 
me from an evil curse.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.520
Yes.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.900
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.720
Forgive me for the wrongs I have done.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:04.670
Mother told me long ago 
that only someone with

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:09.080
all-seeing eyes, 
an open heart, a strong will,

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:12.200
and the strength to lead the world 
could be the Sho of Tsukuyo.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.240
Arata the Sho.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.520
How far are you willing 
to follow your heart?

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.780
Let me ask you one question.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:24.930
What is the one thing you 
value most in this world?

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:34.060
Bonds. Like the one you 
had with your mother.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:45.450
You really gave me a show.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.010
I can't believe you broke that jutsu.

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:51.450
For that, I applaud you.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:53.540
Kadowaki...

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:57.370
But what do you mean by "bonds"?!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.010
Don't you talk about that!

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:05.470
The only thing you need 
to look at is me!

